From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Feb 2026 06:12:45 +0530
Subject: feat: add JS override hooks for navigator.userAgent and userAgentData

Add Blink-level override hooks that allow JS to intercept and modify
navigator.userAgent, navigator.userAgentData, and
navigator.userAgentData.getHighEntropyValues() via expando function
properties (userAgentOverride, userAgentDataOverride,
getHighEntropyValuesOverride).

Changes:
- navigator_id.idl/h: add [CallWith=ScriptState] to userAgent attribute
- navigator_ua.idl/h: add [CallWith=ScriptState] to userAgentData attribute
- navigator_base.cc/h: implement userAgent override hook via ScriptState
- navigator_ua.cc: implement userAgentData override hook
- navigator_ua_data.cc: implement getHighEntropyValues override hook
- navigator_id.cc: fix appVersion() call site for new signature
- navigator_ua.h: remove orphaned MaybeRecordMetrics declaration

